- `has_permission`: was case-sensitive (`"Admin" not in ["Admin"]` when checking `"admin"`). Added `.lower()` on both sides.
- `is_admin_or_owner`: used `and` instead of `or`, so both admin+owner were required. Changed to `or`.

**`src/inventory.py`** (4 bugs):
- `__init__` mutable default arg: `initial={}` was shared across all instances created without args. Changed to `None` with a fresh `{}` inside.
- `add` was overwriting instead of accumulating: `self._stock[sku] = qty` → `self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty`.
- `reserve` boundary: `qty >= available` rejected reserving the full stock. Changed to `qty > available`.
- `release` didn't guard against going negative: released freely without checking `current` quantity. Added `if qty > current: raise ValueError`.

**`src/text_utils.py`** (3 bugs):
- `slugify` didn't lowercase. Added `.lower()` on alnum chars.
- `slugify` only collapsed `--` (double dash) via `str.replace`, missing longer runs. Used `re.sub(r'-+', '-', ...)` instead.
- `truncate` wasn't accounting for suffix length: `text[:max_len] + suffix` could exceed `max_len`. Changed to `text[:max_len - len(suffix)] + suffix`.
